steps.text:
This is supported: “Add Cursor Above/Below” operates on visual (wrapped) lines by default, producing the behavior in your second GIF.

To force logical document lines instead, bind the same command with `logicalLine: true`:

```json
{
  "key": "ctrl+alt+down",
  "command": "editor.action.insertCursorBelow",
  "args": { "logicalLine": true }
}
```
